## scene 6

title:
cue: tense
host:
narration: Nhưng điều kỳ lạ nhất lại xảy ra khi đêm xuống. Trong giai thoại, một con rắn trắng xuất hiện trên xà nhà. Ánh đèn dầu chập chờn.
prompt: Wide 15th-century Đại Việt riverside village at nightfall; thatched and tile-roofed houses huddle behind bamboo hedges, one scholar's house glows with a single oil lamp in its doorway, dark clouds slide across a rising moon, mist creeps over the rice paddies, a dog stands alert at the gate, Vietnamese villagers in nón lá hurry home along the earthen dyke carrying small lanterns. No Ming/Qing Chinese, Japanese, Nguyễn-dynasty or European elements.
